category: Libs
requires: librtlsdr0 pkg-config
sdesc: "Software to turn the RTL2832U into an SDR (development)"
ldesc: "DVB-T dongles based on the Realtek RTL2832U can be used as a cheap SDR, since
the chip allows transferring the raw I/Q samples to the host, which is
officially used for DAB/DAB+/FM demodulation."
external-source: librtlsdr

